            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--ground)"></div><div class="cap">ground</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--surface)"></div><div class="cap">surface</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--surface-2)"></div><div class="cap">surface-2</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--ink)"></div><div class="cap">ink</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--ink-2)"></div><div class="cap">ink-2</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--line-2)"></div><div class="cap">line-2</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <h3>Accent &amp; op semantics</h3>
          <div class="swatches">
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--accent)"></div><div class="cap">accent</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--accent-2)"></div><div class="cap">accent-2</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--create)"></div><div class="cap">create</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--update)"></div><div class="cap">update</div></div>
            <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:var(--delete)"></div><div class="cap">delete</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile" style="grid-column:1/-1">
          <h3>Type scale &mdash; IBM Plex Sans / Mono</h3>
          <div class="type-row"><span class="lab">hero</span><span style="font-size:2.4rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.02em">Change data capture</span></div>
          <div class="type-row"><span class="lab">h2</span><span style="font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:600">Follow the change</span></div>
          <div class="type-row"><span class="lab">body</span><span style="font-size:1rem; color:var(--ink-2)">Captured from the transaction log and turned into an event you can trust.</span></div>
          <div class="type-row"><span class="lab">mono</span><span class="mono" style="font-size:.9rem; color:var(--accent)">lsn 0/1A2B3C0 &middot; op=u</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <h3>Buttons</h3>
          <div class="chips">
            <button class="btn primary sm">Run connector</button>
            <button class="btn ghost sm">Copy config</button>
            <button class="btn danger sm">Drop slot</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <h3>Badges &amp; tags</h3>
          <div class="chips">
            <span class="badge-op c">c create</span>
            <span class="badge-op u">u update</span>
            <span class="badge-op d">d delete</span>
            <span class="badge-lv">Beginner</span>
            <span class="tag concept"><i></i>concept</span>
            <span class="tag ops"><i></i>ops</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <h3>Callouts</h3>
          <div class="stack">
            <div class="callout info"><span class="ic">i</span><span>Log-based CDC reads the WAL &mdash; no polling, no query load.</span></div>
            <div class="callout success"><span class="ic">+</span><span>Sink is idempotent: replays converge to the same state.</span></div>
            <div class="callout warn"><span class="ic">!</span><span><code class="inl">ts_ms</code> is millisecond-coarse; tie-break on log position.</span></div>
            <div class="callout error"><span class="ic">&times;</span><span>Dropped the replication slot on a live stream &mdash; WAL recycled.</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile">
          <h3>Progress toast</h3>
          <div class="chips" style="margin-bottom:16px"><span class="toast"><span class="tk">&#10003;</span>Module complete &mdash; offset saved</span></div>
          <div class="meter" style="max-width:260px"><b style="width:40%"></b></div>
          <div class="meter-lbl" style="max-width:260px"><span>series progress</span><span>10 / 24</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tile" style="grid-column:1/-1">
          <h3>Search overlay</h3>
          <div class="search-mock">
            <div class="sfield"><span class="mono" style="color:var(--ink-3)">&#8981;</span><input value="tombstone" aria-label="Search demo" readonly><kbd class="mono" style="font-size:.7rem; color:var(--ink-3); border:1px solid var(--line-2); border-radius:4px; padding:1px 6px">esc</kbd></div>
            <div class="res">
              <div class="r on"><b>CDC Glossary &mdash; <mark>tombstone</mark></b><span>A delete marker with a null value that lets log compaction drop a key.</span></div>
              <div class="r"><b>Materialization</b><span>Apply deletes as <mark>tombstone</mark>s that remove or flag the row.</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
